# Next.js 16

This is NOT the Next.js you know. APIs, conventions, and file structure may differ from training data.

Before writing Next.js-specific code (routing, metadata, images, fonts, configs, caching):

- Read the relevant guide under `node_modules/next/dist/docs/`
- Heed deprecation notices

Use App Router under `src/app/`. Prefer Server Components; add `"use client"` only when required.
